                "<b>Level sums</b> (slides 1.47–1.49): level 0 is cn. Level 1 is cn/2 + cn/2 = cn. Level 2 is 4 × cn/4 = cn.",
                "General level d: 2<sup>d</sup> nodes, each of size n/2<sup>d</sup>, each costing c·n/2<sup>d</sup>. Multiply: 2<sup>d</sup> × c·n/2<sup>d</sup> = cn. The 2<sup>d</sup> cancels.",
                "<b>Leaves</b> (slide 1.50): the number doubles each level, so at depth lg n there are 2<sup>lg n</sup> = n leaves. They cost n × Θ(1) = Θ(n).",
