              "<b>Step-by-Step Dijkstra Settlement from <code>s</code></b>:<br>1. <b>Init at <code>s</code></b>: $d[s]=0$. Relax out of $s$: $d[2]=9(p=s),\\; d[6]=14(p=s),\\; d[7]=15(p=s)$.<br>2. <b>Extract <code>2</code> ($d[2]=9$)</b>: Relax $2\\to 3$: $d[3]=9+24=33(p=2)$.<br>3. <b>Extract <code>6</code> ($d[6]=14$)</b>: Relax $6\\to 3$: $d[3]=\\min(33, 14+18)=32(p=6)$; $6\\to 5$: $d[5]=14+30=44(p=6)$; $6\\to 7$: $14+5=19 > 15$.<br>4. <b>Extract <code>7</code> ($d[7]=15$)</b>: Relax $7\\to 5$: $d[5]=\\min(44, 15+20)=35(p=7)$; $7\\to t$: $d[t]=15+44=59(p=7)$.<br>5. <b>Extract <code>3</code> ($d[3]=32$)</b>: Relax $3\\to t$: $d[t]=\\min(59, 32+19)=51(p=3)$.<br>6. <b>Extract <code>5</code> ($d[5]=35$)</b>: Relax $5\\to 3$: $35+2=37 > 32$; $5\\to 4$: $d[4]=35+11=46(p=5)$; $5\\to t$: $d[t]=\\min(51, 35+16)=51(p=3/5)$.<br>7. <b>Extract <code>4</code> ($d[4]=46$)</b>: Relax $4\\to t$: $46+6=52 > 51$.<br>8. <b>Extract <code>t</code> ($d[t]=51$)</b>.<br><b>Final Distances & Predecessors</b>: <code>2: 9(s), 6: 14(s), 7: 15(s), 3: 32(6), 5: 35(7), 4: 46(5), t: 51(3 or 5)</code>.<br><b>Shortest Path $s \\leadsto t$</b>: <code>s → 6 → 3 → t</code> ($14 + 18 + 19 = \\mathbf{51}$) or <code>s → 7 → 5 → t</code> ($15 + 20 + 16 = \\mathbf{51}$).",
