                "Examples: log<sub>2</sub> 8 = 3 because 2<sup>3</sup> = 8. log<sub>10</sub> 1000 = 3 because 10<sup>3</sup> = 1000. For any base, log<sub>b</sub> 1 = 0 and log<sub>b</sub> b = 1.",
