                "To <b>exchange</b> (swap) two cells means to trade their values. The slides write it <code>exchange A[i] ↔ A[j]</code>. It needs one temporary cell (← means \"assign\": store the value on the right in the cell on the left):<ul><li>temp ← A[i]</li><li>A[i] ← A[j]</li><li>A[j] ← temp</li></ul>",
