              "code": "PARTITION(A, p, q)   // A[p .. q]\n1  x ← A[p]          // pivot = A[p]\n2  i ← p\n3  for j ← p + 1 to q\n4    do if A[j] ≤ x\n5       then i ← i + 1\n6            exchange A[i] ↔ A[j]\n7  exchange A[p] ↔ A[i]\n8  return i\n\nRAND-PARTITION(A, p, q)\n1  t ← random index in p .. q\n2  exchange A[p] ↔ A[t]\n3  return PARTITION(A, p, q)",
