            "An <b>algorithm</b> is a finite sequence of instructions that, if followed, accomplishes a particular task (slide 2.21).",
            "Algorithms must satisfy five criteria:<ul><li><b>Input</b>: zero or more quantities are externally supplied</li><li><b>Output</b>: at least one quantity is produced</li><li><b>Definiteness</b>: each instruction is clear and unambiguous</li><li><b>Finiteness</b>: for all cases it terminates after a finite number of steps</li><li><b>Efficiency</b>: it uses a reasonable amount of resources and time, so it is feasible to run</li></ul>",
