            "<b>Divide and conquer</b> solves an instance in three steps:<ul><li><b>Divide</b>: cut it into smaller instances of the same problem (subproblems)</li><li><b>Conquer</b>: solve each subproblem the same way</li><li><b>Combine</b>: build the full answer from the sub-answers</li></ul>",
