            "<b>Step 4.</b> M<sup>16</sup> = (M<sup>8</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = $\\begin{pmatrix}1156 + 441&714 + 273\\\\714 + 273&441 + 169\\end{pmatrix}$ = $\\begin{pmatrix}1597&987\\\\987&610\\end{pmatrix}$.",
