            "<b>The fact on Slide 5.42</b>: for n ≥ 2, Σ<sub>k=2</sub><sup>n−1</sup> k lg k ≤ ½ n<sup>2</sup> lg n − ⅛ n<sup>2</sup>. The slide leaves it as an exercise; here is the proof.",
