            "Line 1: Σ<sub>k=2</sub><sup>n−1</sup> k lg k = Σ<sub>k=1</sub><sup>m−1</sup> k lg k + Σ<sub>k=m</sub><sup>n−1</sup> k lg k. We split at m and add the k = 1 term, which is 1 · lg 1 = 0.",
