            "Bounds on a floor: x − 1 &lt; ⌊x⌋ ≤ x. Example x = 8.8: 7.8 &lt; 8 ≤ 8.8. Bounds on a ceiling: x ≤ ⌈x⌉ &lt; x + 1.",
