            "Slide 8.23: amortized cost = (1 + 2 + 3 + 1 + 5 + 1 + 1 + 1 + 9 + 1 + …) / n ≤ (n + 2n) / n = 3, so the amortized cost of one insertion is <b>O(1)</b>. (The slide's sum leaves out c₄ = 1 and c₈ = 1.)",
