          "Division & Multiplication Hash Functions",
          "Division: h(k) = k mod m, m prime, not near a power of 2. Multiplication: h(k) = ⌊m (kA mod 1)⌋ with 0 < A < 1 (slides: A = 0.618033); m is not critical."
